# The review screen following a worktree that moves: open the greeter's diff, then let the
# agent's checkout change underneath it, and watch cwd sync report the move and the diff catch up.
key k
sleep 500ms
key d
wait hello, reviewer
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
sleep 3s
key Escape
